cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use economize in your research, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "economize: Composable Efficiency Techniques for Hugging Face Language Models"
abstract: >-
  economize equips any Hugging Face causal language model with any combination of efficiency techniques, among them
  speculative decoding, early exit, layer skipping, quantization, pruning and KV-cache
  compression, behind one interface for decoding, training, saving and serving.
authors:
  - family-names: Laitenberger
    given-names: Filipe
    email: f.laitenberger@gmail.com
repository-code: "https://github.com/Thiggel/economize"
url: "https://github.com/Thiggel/economize"
license: Apache-2.0
version: 0.4.0
date-released: "2026-11-04"
keywords:
  - large language models
  - inference efficiency
  - speculative decoding
  - early exit
  - quantization
  - transformers
